[00:00.92]"When reality smashes my dream to bits, I mope and snarl while the first shock lasts, and then patiently, idiotically, start putting it together again? And so always? However often the house of cards falls, shall I set about rebuilding it?"
[00:58.26]"We're now building one home each day."
[01:02.21]"For there is nowhere to go."
